{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["在创建新",["l","农场地图","农场地图"],"时，不管是单人游玩还是",["l","合作","合作"],"游玩，只要",["l","选项#多人游戏设置","设置了“初始联机小屋”"],"的数目，",["l","联机小屋","联机小屋"],"就会在农场上的不同位置生成。生成的位置主要取决于玩家在“联机小屋布局”中设置的是“独立”还是“附近”。"]],["p",["像其他农场建筑一样，玩家可以通过",["l","木匠的商店","木匠的商店"],"来移动联机小屋的位置，或拆除联机小屋。在游戏后期，完成了",["l","任务#Goblin Problem","“哥布林问题”剧情任务"],"后，玩家也可以通过法师塔内的魔法书来移动农场建筑。"]],["p",["下表展示了不同",["l","农场地图","农场地图"],"在选择3个或7个初始联机小屋时，分别选择“附近”和“独立”两个选项时的位置。"]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["农场地图"]},{"h":1,"v":["4人接近"]},{"h":1,"v":["4人独立"]},{"h":1,"v":["8人接近"]},{"h":1,"v":["8人独立"]}],[["标准农场"],[["f","1.5.6_standard_close.thumb.webp",250]],[["f","1.5.6_standard_far.thumb.webp",250]],[["f","1.6_8p_standard_close.thumb.webp",250]],[["f","1.6_8p_standard_separate.thumb.webp",250]]],[["河边农场"],[["f","1.5.6_river_close.thumb.webp",250]],[["f","1.5.6_river_far.thumb.webp",250]],[["f","1.6_8p_river_close.thumb.webp",250]],[["f","1.6_8p_river_separate.thumb.webp",250]]],[["森林农场"],[["f","1.5.6_forest_close.thumb.webp",250]],[["f","1.5.6_forest_far.thumb.webp",250]],[["f","1.6_8p_forest_close.thumb.webp",250]],[["f","1.6_8p_forest_separate.thumb.webp",250]]],[["山顶农场"],[["f","1.5.6_hilltop_close.thumb.webp",250]],[["f","1.5.6_hilltop_far.thumb.webp",250]],[["f","1.6_8p_hilltop_close.thumb.webp",250]],[["f","1.6_8p_hilltop_separate.thumb.webp",250]]],[["荒野农场"],[["f","1.5.6_wild_close.thumb.webp",250]],[["f","1.5.6_wild_far.thumb.webp",250]],[["f","1.6_8p_wild_close.thumb.webp",250]],[["f","1.6_8p_wild_separate.thumb.webp",250]]],[["四角农场"],[["f","1.5.6_corners_close.thumb.webp",250]],[["f","1.5.6_corners_far.thumb.webp",250]],[["f","1.6_8p_corners_close.thumb.webp",250]],[["f","1.6_8p_corners_separate.thumb.webp",250]]],[["海滩农场"],[["f","1.5.6_beach_close.thumb.webp",250]],[["f","1.5.6_beach_far.thumb.webp",250]],[["f","1.6_8p_beach_close.thumb.webp",250]],[["f","1.6_8p_beach_separate.thumb.webp",250]]],[["草原农场"],[["f","1.6_meadow_close.thumb.webp",250]],[["f","1.6_meadow_far.thumb.webp",250]],[["f","1.6_8p_meadow_close.thumb.webp